# ==============================================================================
# Pathfile: .gitattributes
# Description: Global Git configuration enforcing LF line endings and binary 
#              file definitions. Prevents Godot 4 MD5 hash mismatches and 
#              infinite import loops across Windows and WSL/Linux environments.
# Author: Enrique González Gutiérrez
# Email: enrique.gonzalez.gutierrez@gmail.com
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. DEFAULT BEHAVIOR
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auto-detect text files, always normalize to LF (Linux) on checkout and commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. GODOT ENGINE SPECIFIC FILES
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Force LF on all Godot engine configuration and scene files to prevent 
# cache invalidation and re-import loops in the editor.
*.gd text eol=lf
*.gdshader text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.import text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
project.godot text eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. DOMAIN DATA & DOCUMENTATION
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enforce LF on JSON databases (quests, recipes, dialogues) and Markdown files.
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. BINARY ASSETS (ABSOLUTE SAFEGUARD)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Strictly mark assets as binary so Git NEVER attempts line-ending conversions 
# or text diffing, which would permanently corrupt the files.

# 3D Models
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.fbx binary
*.bin binary

# Textures & Images
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.svg binary

# Audio & Video
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogv binary